/* Help */
"Help" = "說明";
"Tap a card to pick it. Tap it again to put it back." = "點一下選一張牌，再點一下就放回。";
"Double-tap takes the pair or three of that rank, or the whole suit when you hold five or more of it." = "點兩下選同點數的對子或三條；若同一花色手上有五張或以上，就選整個花色。";
"Hold a card to take every card of that rank." = "長按一張牌，選出手上所有同點數的牌。";
"Lead and Play send the cards you picked. Pass stays out. You cannot pass a lead. The empty box clears the pick." = "「出牌」送出已選的牌；「過」即是不跟，但先出時不能過。空白方格清除選擇。";
"The sort button shows ♠ or 2: that is the order a tap switches to." = "排序按鈕上的 ♠ 或 2，是點一下之後會換成的排法。";
"The player with the 3♦ leads the first deal. Match the play on the table with a higher one, or pass." = "拿到 3♦ 的人第一舖先出。之後要用相同牌型、而且更大的牌壓過枱面的牌，否則就過。";
"Two or three of a kind: higher rank wins, then the highest suit among them." = "對子、三條：先比點數，點數相同再比當中最大的花色。";
"Five cards, from low to high: straight, flush, full house, four of a kind, straight flush." = "五張牌由細到大：順子、同花、葫蘆、四條、同花順。";
"A straight runs A2345, then 23456, up to TJQKA. JQKA2 is not a straight." = "順子由細到大是 A2345、23456，一直到 TJQKA；JQKA2 不算順子。";
"A straight is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. In A2345 the high card is the 5." = "順子比最大的那一張，點數相同再比它的花色。A2345 的最大牌是 5。";
"A flush is ranked by its highest card, then that card's suit. A full house by the three of a kind. Four of a kind by the four." = "同花比最大的一張，再比它的花色；葫蘆比三條的點數；四條比那四張的點數。";
"Each card left costs its rank: 3 is 1, up to 2 which is 13. Ten or more cards left doubles the cost. The winner takes all three totals." = "手上每剩一張牌就按點數扣分：3 計 1 分，順序到 2 計 13 分；剩十張或以上雙倍。贏家收齊其餘三家的分數。";
"A game is ten deals." = "一局十舖。";
"With Hong Kong rules, from the next deal: the last winner leads, and 23456 is the highest straight." = "用港式規則，由下一舖起：上一舖的贏家先出，23456 成為最大的順子。";
"Enter your name. The dark row is you. Leave a row blank to keep its name." = "輸入你的名字。深色那一列是你。留空就保留原來的名字。";
